WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.101
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:04.136
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:07.507
You're here. You made it.
You're gathered with the family.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.343
I want to wish everyone a very
happy Thanksgiving right now.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.712
Happy Thanksgiving, everyone.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.417
Round of applause -- how many
of you are asleep right now?

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:20.987
Well, you're going to want
to wake up for this,

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.155
because we have an amazing show.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.991
The one-and-only Cher
is my guest tonight.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.027
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.264
Earlier today, Cher headlined

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.366
the Macy's Thanksgiving
Day Parade.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.902
[ Cheers and applause ]
That was --

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.470
That actually wasn't planned.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.571
Whenever she drives down
the street,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:39.638
a parade forms around her.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.640
That's just what happens.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.342
That's right --
today was the 97th

00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:44.444
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:45.845
It was really fun.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.813
Although, at one point,
there was a large gust of wind,

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.682
and the SpongeBob balloon
got its nipple pierced

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.083
by the Chrysler Building.

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.886
It's really interesting.

00:00:54.286 --> 00:00:57.089
I hope you all had
a great Thanksgiving.

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:59.024
Once again,
I overdid it on the food.

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:01.727
After dinner, I dropped
an Alka-Seltzer into some Pepto

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:05.965
into some Gas-x and called it
a medical turducken.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.168
I love how after dinner, we're
like, "I won't eat for a week,"

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:10.136
and then, three hours later,
we're standing over the sink,

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.938
gnawing on a cold drumstick.

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:15.575
My family actually doesn't have
turkey on Thanksgiving.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.510
Because of my relationship
with NBC,

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.313
we're only allowed
to eat peacock.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.351
Yeah.

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:28.354
Actually, it was
a great Thanksgiving,

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.789
but it's almost midnight now,

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.924
and on behalf of everyone
at home watching,

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.694
there's something
I need to say.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:37.730
♪♪

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:42.501
Guests, get out.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:46.472
I'm serious.
Button up your pants and leave.

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.675
I'm talking to you, Pamela.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:52.879
You're not "family."
Go digest in your own home.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.281
Meredith, stop offering
to do the dishes,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.183
because now everyone
has to pretend

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.650
that they were going to
clean the kitchen tonight,

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.121
which they
definitely were not.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.056
By the way, Brian,
we all noticed

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:05.725
that noise your body
made 10 minutes ago.

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:09.629
That was scary. Get some help.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:14.334
Meredith, I wasn't joking.
Out. Now.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:18.471
Well, I guess if you're staying,

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:22.675
I just learned to play
"Wonderwall" on the guitar.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.477
Oh, now you're leaving?

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.212
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.450
[ Turkey gobbling ]

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.685
Well, I saw that
President Biden and his family

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:35.087
spent Thanksgiving in Nantucket.

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:37.623
Yeah, Biden made sure
an authentic Thanksgiving meal

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:39.058
was served, and he would know

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:42.462
because he was there
for the first one.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:44.163
Meanwhile,
former president Trump

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:46.165
also celebrated Thanksgiving.

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.033
Yep. It's a little different
at the Trumps' house.

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:49.235
When they cook the turkey,

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.771
it's over three days
in a tanning bed.

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:54.540
Ron DeSantis
had a good Thanksgiving,

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.942
although things got
a little tense

00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:57.010
when he yelled,
"For the last time,

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.212
why am I seated
at the kids' table?"

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:03.082
Finally, guys, what is
Thanksgiving without football?

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:05.618
You know...
